# No Agent Attribution

Nothing you write may advertise the tool that wrote it. This applies to commit
messages, commit trailers, PR titles and bodies, code comments, and docs.

Never emit any of these:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any agent co-author trailer)
- `Made with Cursor`, `Generated with Cursor`, or a link to cursor.com
- `🤖 Generated with …`, `Co-Authored-By: Claude`, or equivalents from other tools
- Comments such as `// added by AI`, `// Cursor generated this`

A commit message ends with its last content line. Do not append a trailer block.

```
# ❌ BAD
Fix camera tile black blink on live selection.

Made with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

# ✅ GOOD
Fix camera tile black blink on live selection.
```

Swift file headers use the existing template — filename, project, then
`Copyright © <year> Moxie LLC. All rights reserved.` Do not add anything else.
